Request <pre>POST /interactive/user/session

{
  "clientId":  "RM12345",
  "password":  "••••••••"
}</pre> Response <pre>{
  "type": "success",
  "result": {
    "token":  "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...",
    "userID": "RM12345",
    "isInvestorClient": false
  }
}</pre>

String <p>Stores text values — exchange names, symbols, order sides.</p> <pre>{ "exchangeSegment": "NSECM" }</pre> Integer <p>Stores whole numbers — quantities, instrument IDs.</p> <pre>{ "quantity": 100 }</pre> Double <p>Stores decimal values — prices, stop loss levels.</p> <pre>{ "price": 2500.50 }</pre> Boolean <p>Stores true/false flags — investor type, spread orders.</p> <pre>{ "isInvestorClient": true }</pre> Array <p>Stores multiple values — order sides, segments.</p> <pre>{ "orderSide": ["BUY","SELL"] }</pre> Object <p>Groups related fields — exchange info, nested configs.</p> <pre>{ "exchangeInfo": {
  "NSECM": { "productType": "MIS" }
}}</pre>

Request <pre>GET /interactive/orders
Host: xts.rmoneyindia.co.in:3000
Authorization: eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...
Content-Type: application/json</pre> Response <pre>{
  "type": "success",
  "result": [
    {
      "AppOrderID": 1234567890,
      "TradingSymbol": "RELIANCE",
      "OrderSide": "BUY",
      "OrderQuantity": 10,
      "OrderStatus": "Open"
    }
  ]
}</pre>

Success Response <pre>{
  "type": "success",
  "code": "s-order-0003",
